-- Relative totalisation and categorical comparison, 2026-10-29.
-- Detailed informal proof and review: unit/doc/relative-totalisation.tex.
-- Definitions, transport equations, actual algebra diagrams, rebasing,
-- gluing, fibres, and categorical packaging follow its numbered sections.
-- Commuting paths and the geometric fibre inverse are opaque after their
-- interfaces.  The cover proof names the pointwise square before ext.
